        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/key-material-export-length-boundaries",
          "ruleIndex": 16,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "key material export length/boundaries — Ruled out: tls_srtp_key export\n\nNamed control: tls_srtp_key derives exactly (16+14)*2 = 60 bytes into a 60-byte local array and returns that size; the only internal caller _private_dtls_ensure_keys uses an identically sized 60-byte buffer and splits it at 0/16/32/46 (tlse.c:13947-13980), so key and salt boundaries match. Export requires master_key to be set and returns TLS_GENERIC_ERROR otherwise."
          },
          "locations": [
